1
00:00:00,744 --> 00:00:03,534
(Sheldon:)- Well?
- I reiterate. Knuckle under.

2
00:00:04,164 --> 00:00:05,834
Oh, no, no, no. It is on.

3
00:00:05,999 --> 00:00:08,419
I'm gonna introduce your friend
to a world of hurt.

4
00:00:08,585 --> 00:00:11,045
(Leonard:)Oh, Penny,
you don't wanna get into it with Sheldon.

5
00:00:11,212 --> 00:00:15,012
The guy's one lab accident away
from being a super villain.

6
00:00:16,092 --> 00:00:20,892
(Penny:)I don't care. I was in junior rodeo. I can
hogtie and castrate him in 60 seconds.

7
00:00:22,682 --> 00:00:25,972
(Howard:)No need to neuter the nerd.
I can get you back online.

8
00:00:26,352 --> 00:00:27,392
(Leonard:)There, see?

9
00:00:27,562 --> 00:00:29,522
(Leonard:)Problem solved.

10
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:31,860
Voilà.

11
00:00:32,025 --> 00:00:34,905
SHELDON:
Hello, puny insects.

12
00:00:35,987 --> 00:00:38,777
(Sheldon(voice from Howards laptop):)As a consequence of your efforts
to circumvent my will...

13
00:00:38,948 --> 00:00:42,748
(Sheldon(voice from Howards laptop):)...everyone is awarded
one additional strike.

14
00:00:44,537 --> 00:00:45,747
(Leonard:)Thanks a lot, Howard.

15
00:00:46,206 --> 00:00:50,166
(Howard:)What are you complaining about?
I'm the one who has to take the class again.

16
00:00:56,883 --> 00:00:59,023
(Sheldon:)Oh!

